      <description>&lt;p&gt;&amp;hellip; you need some distraction / inspiration in a completely different direction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Just came from a bit of a &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GazJC5cAcIw&amp;amp;t=8s&#34;&gt;mellow HipHop&lt;/a&gt; October mood over great interviews in the &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.romeshranganathan.co.uk/podcast/&#34;&gt;Romesh Ranganathan Show&lt;/a&gt;, incl. Loyle Carner, to this wonderful conversation with Stephen Graham. What a great vibe  &amp;#x1f44c; &amp;#x1f60e;&lt;/p&gt;
