    <item>
      <title>Just in case ... </title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/culture_august/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/culture_august/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&amp;hellip; you need a good read at the intersection of novel, philosophy, and hands-on discussion of engineering design it is time to revisit &lt;a href=&#34;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zen_and_the_Art_of_Motorcycle_Maintenance&#34;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Zen and the Art of Motorcycle Maintenance&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Finally managed to read it in full and, while definitely an unconventional book, definitely a great one.  And even some nicely concise explanations &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/files/Zen.pdf&#34;&gt;On the Scientific Method&lt;/a&gt; included for free. But that might be too much of an academic&amp;rsquo;s perspective on a summer read &amp;#x1f393; &amp;#x263a;&amp;#xfe0f;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
